Third-party material
====================

Medabots RPG for Archipelago is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
It contains documented game facts that were first published by another
community project, used here under that project's MIT License:

  Medabots Randomizer (https://github.com/STulling/Medabots-Randomizer)

The facts taken from it are:

  * the ROM header identifiers of the four English ROM versions,
  * the event-script opcode length table,
  * the part, medal, map and character name tables, and the record layouts
    of the battle and part tables,
  * a few addresses and byte signatures used to locate data inside the ROM.

These live in worlds/medabots_rpg/data/game_tables.json and
worlds/medabots_rpg/data/rom_versions.json.

